    "Maintain a vector max accumulator (vmaxq_s64) across column iterations",
    "Use OpenMP parallel for with reduction(max:mxSum) over rows of submatrices",
    "Allocate prefix-sum array with aligned_alloc(16) to satisfy NEON alignment requirements"
